  "body": "class Queue: \"\"\"Queue implementation as a list\"\"\" def __init__(self): \"\"\"Create new queue\"\"\" self._items = [] def is_empty(self): \"\"\"Check if the queue is empty\"\"\" return not bool(self._items) def enqueue(self, item): \"\"\"Add an item to the queue\"\"\" self._items.insert(0, item) def dequeue(self): \"\"\"Remove an item from the queue\"\"\" return self._items.pop() def size(self): \"\"\"Get the number of items in the queue\"\"\" return len(self._items) "
