  "title": "",
  "body": "  Q-9: How is a csv writer different from a file writer?      You can write all the rows at once    No, you still write out each line one at a time      It automatically adds a new line    Yes, it automatically adds a new line      You write out a list of values    Yes, you write out a list of values rather than a string      It automatically converts numbers to strings to write each line    Yes, it automatically converts values to strings     "
