  "number": "7.7.3",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  Construct a block of code with two functions. The first function is called printFlavors, which lists the available flavors. The second function should print the products and call the first function. Finally, call the second function. Watch your indentation! Hint: there is one unused code block.     def printFlavors():    print(\"Vanilla\")  print(\"Chocolate\")  print(\"Strawberry\")    def printProducts():    print(\"Ice cream\")  print(\"Milkshake\")  print(\"Frozen yogurt\")  print(\"************\")  print(\"Flavors:\")  printFlavors()    print(\"Ice cream\")  print(\"Milkshake\")  print(\"Frozen yogurt\")  print(\"************\")  print(\"Flavors:\")  print(printFlavors())    printProducts()    "
