  "body": "  Create a function called swap_keys_values that takes in dictionary as a parameter and returns swapped_dictionary that swaps the keys and values of the passed in dictionary . For example, swap_keys_values({'a':1, 'b': 2, 'c':7}) would return {1: 'a', 2: 'b', 7: 'c'} .     def swap_keys_values(dictionary):    swapped_dictionary = {}     for item in dictionary.items():    for item in dictionary():      swapped_dictionary[item[1]] = item[0]    swapped_dictionary[item[0]] = item[1]     swapped_dictionary[item[1]].append(item[0])    return swapped_dictionary    "
